      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CINDY'S PATCH (1) broke from the inside draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only 1.5 lengths (18.42) behind Irinka Fred at this track. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Rates highly and will give a great sight. KIANDO PIPER (2) was well backed last start but ran below expectations when fourth (23.69), beaten 3 lengths. Was in the money the start prior. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from five starts. Should be about the money. ORANA JOEL (6) has been in super consistent form recently with three minors on end before breaking through for an overdue win (18.41) at this track. Looks well placed here and has the ability. Go well. ",
